# Place the licensed TradingView Charting Library bundle here.
#
# 1. Request access: https://www.tradingview.com/charting-library-docs/
# 2. Copy the `charting_library/` folder from the private repository into this directory.
# 3. Expected entry: public/charting_library/charting_library.standalone.js
#
# IRIS auto-detects this bundle and switches from the legacy Lightweight Charts
# fallback to TradingView Advanced Charts.
